{"id":"664860","name":"薏米木耳大骨汤","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664860/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"薏米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"大骨","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"薏米提前泡发洗净。","img":"images/664860/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"木耳提前泡发备用。","img":"images/664860/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"大骨冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净。","img":"images/664860/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将大骨放入高压锅中。","img":"images/664860/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入薏米。","img":"images/664860/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/664860/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"大火煮开压15分钟。","img":"images/664860/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"分钟后开盖将汤底煮开。","img":"images/664860/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入木耳。","img":"images/664860/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大火煮开后继续煲五分钟左右，少许盐调味即可。","img":"images/664860/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664860/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664860/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664860/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664860/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}